 ('Write a 7-sentence biography with at least four pseudo-cleft sentences.','Ayla Moreira is a linguist. What drove her was curiosity. All she needed was a library and a notebook. What surprised her teachers was her patience. The reason why she moved abroad was that no one studied her language. What she did next was to create the first dictionary of her community. What matters most to her is that children can read it.',['Usei **4 pseudo-clivadas**','7 frases'],'7 frases'),
