 G('Revisão: pseudo-clivadas e That is not to say…',['Estrutura','Exemplo'],[['What + S + V + is/was…','**What reviewers do is to scrutinize methods.**'],['All + S + V + is…','**All they ask for is clarity.**'],['The reason why… is that…','**The reason why papers are rejected is that claims outrun evidence.**'],['That is not to say that… (ressalva)','**That is not to say that every flaw is fatal.**']],'**That is not to say that…** introduz uma **ressalva** a algo que acabou de ser dito: “isso não quer dizer que…”.'),
