 ('Reading · A review',text('Review: “The Methods Workshop” ★★★★☆',['This workshop **goes into** detail on survey design. The trainer **goes through** every step and **goes ahead** with real examples. Not everyone **goes along with** her view of sampling, but the ideas **went down well**.','You cannot **go without** a solid plan, she warns. As time **goes by**, the techniques become second nature. I would **go for** the advanced session next.'],kicker='REVIEW',by='Review by Mira',gloss=[('sampling','amostragem'),('detail','detalhe'),('technique','técnica'),('advanced','avançado')])),
 [('The workshop goes into detail on survey design.','T','goes into detail.'),('Everyone agrees with the trainer’s view.','F','Not everyone goes along with.'),('The reviewer will take the advanced session.','T','go for the advanced.')],
 [('“go along with” = ?',['concordar com','ir junto','passar por'],0,'goes along with.'),('“sampling” = ?',['amostragem','sapateado','saltar'],0,'sampling.')],
 G('Verbo-chave: go',['Expressão','Significado','Exemplo'],[['go through','examinar; passar por','**She goes through every step.**'],['go ahead','prosseguir','**Go ahead with the plan.**'],['go along with','concordar com','**I go along with your view.**'],['go into','entrar em detalhes','**It goes into detail.**'],['go without','passar sem','**You can’t go without a plan.**'],['go down well','ser bem recebido','**The idea went down well.**']],'**go** + preposição forma muitos phrasal verbs. Atenção: **go through** pode ser “examinar” ou “enfrentar (dificuldades)”.'),
 [('The trainer goes ___ every step. (through)','through','go through.',None),('Not everyone goes along ___ her view. (with)','with','go along with.',None),('The ideas went ___ well. (down)','down','go down well.',None),('You cannot go ___ a solid plan. (without)','without','go without.',None)],
 V('methods workshop=oficina de métodos|survey design=desenho de questionário|sampling technique=técnica de amostragem|advanced session=sessão avançada|training review=resenha de treinamento|trainer’s view=visão do instrutor|real example=exemplo real|step-by-step guide=guia passo a passo|technique mastery=domínio da técnica|workshop feedback=retorno da oficina|course handout=material do curso|learning pace=ritmo de aprendizagem|question time=tempo para perguntas|practice exercise=exercício prático|group activity=atividade em grupo|workshop rating=nota da oficina|class discussion=discussão em sala|response bias=viés de resposta|questionnaire wording=redação do questionário|pilot survey=levantamento piloto|random sample=amostra aleatória|sample frame=lista de amostragem|data cleaning=limpeza de dados|workshop series=série de oficinas|methods textbook=manual de métodos|trainer credentials=credenciais do instrutor|skill upgrade=aprimoramento de habilidade|learning takeaway=aprendizado principal'),
 ('Workshop chat',[('Ana','Did the trainer go into detail?','O instrutor entrou em detalhes?'),('Leo','Yes, she went through every step.','Sim, passou por cada etapa.'),('Ana','Did everyone go along with her view?','Todos concordaram com a visão dela?'),('Leo','Not everyone, but it went down well.','Nem todos, mas foi bem recebida.')]),
 [('Use go through.','Use.','Let’s go through the plan.'),('Use go ahead.','Use.','Go ahead and start.'),('Use go along with.','Use.','I don’t go along with that idea.')],
 ('Write a 5-sentence review using go into, go through, go along with and go down well.','This workshop goes into detail on survey design. The trainer goes through every step with real examples. Not everyone goes along with her view of sampling, but the ideas went down well. You cannot go without a solid plan, she says. I would go for the advanced session next.',['Usei **go into / through / along with**','5 frases'],'5 frases'),
